<attribute name="problem" nodeId="22d15887">&lt;p&gt;
    EY&apos;s Chart of Accounts (CoA) Mapper serves as a centralized configuration wizard that accelerates CoA segment mapping
    between disparate source systems and target systems. It facilitates the alignment and integration of CoA segments
    during data migration and system integrations, particularly in scenarios involving subsidiaries, mergers, and
    acquisitions. It offers a scalable and user-friendly solution that supports global expansion and MA activities without
    disrupting existing interface mappings.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;img class=&quot;fitImage&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; src=&quot;./../../../process.adv.eya_oracle.base/guidances/practices/resources/coa.jpg&quot; /&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Please contact &lt;a class=&quot;urlFileLink&quot; href=&quot;mailto:Tushar.Pant@gds.ey.com&quot;&gt;Tushar Pant&lt;/a&gt; for more information and
    access to this tool.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
